<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Experience managing director resigns.</title>
<headline>NZ Experience managing director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Experience Managing Director Andrew Clements said on Monday he would resign from the company on October 25 following the company's annual meeting.</p>
<p>Following the comprehensive restructuring of the company's Gondola operations in Christchurch, and despite inclement weather in the Auckland region, NZ Experience said it was trading to budget in the first quarter of the new financial year.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
